            "stageIntent": "SekII foundation in retained current CrossStage/SekII views; no new stage override",
            "role": "own-explicit-acquisition-foundation-for-retained-targets",
            "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
            "sourceContextAndLimits": "Hamburg GYO2022, physisch/gedruckt30, S1–4/2.4: gemeinsamer Inhalt ist Brønsted, Oxonium/Hydroxid, pH und starke Säure-/Basentitration; zusätzliche quantitative schwache Protolyse/Titrationskurven sind erhöht. Die ganze neunstoffige Arrhenius-Namens-/Lösungsroutine steht hier nicht als Vollvorgabe. Sie wird als eigener vorbereitender Erwerbsumfang für die schon verfassten GK/LK-Targets beibehalten; keine zusätzliche amtliche Pflicht oder tatsächliche Themenwahl.",
            "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Whole unchanged nine-substance Arrhenius P: five acid/four hydroxide names and formulas, solution names, hydrated H3O+/OH-, HCl(g) versus hydrochloric acid, clear limewater and conditional dissociation/solubility. Existing18-card bidirectional recall remains separate.",
            "compilerInputBoundary": "Only existing supported applicabilityOverrides.jurisdiction is used; course/stage/view fields describe placements and do not implement new compiler dimensions.",
            "practicalEvidenceBoundary": "All original actual execution, independent planning, own raw log/digital product/reflection and local safety-release duties remain. Synthetic numbers, author answers and old review metadata are not learner evidence.",
            "officialChoiceBoundary": "Concrete own route supporting already authored targets; no universal state requirement, personal theme selection or new runtime topic selector is claimed."
          },
          {
            "extensionId": "arrhenius-or-HE-terminal-foundation-DE-MV-28bb9d15",
            "jurisdiction": "DE-MV",
            "viewIds": [
              "de-mv-gym-chemistry-gk",
              "de-mv-gym-chemistry-lk"
            ],
            "courseProfiles": [
              "GK",
              "LK"
            ],
            "stageIntent": "SekII foundation in retained current CrossStage/SekII views; no new stage override",
            "role": "own-explicit-acquisition-foundation-for-retained-targets",
            "officialWholeSourceCredit": false,
            "sourceContextAndLimits": "MV Erprobungsfassung Gymnasium11/12, physisch28/gedruckt24 nennt Arrhenius im gemeinsamen verbindlichen Inhalt links; rechts stehen Hinweise. Physisch29/gedruckt25 beginnt ausdrücklich zusätzlich LK. Der gemeinsame Arrheniuskontext trägt die Grundidee, schreibt aber nicht sämtliche neun Stoff-/Lösungsnamen und jeden ganzen P-Transfer vor. Die vollständige eigene Routine ergänzt beide vorhandenen GK/LK-Targets, ohne LK-Zusätze umzudeuten oder Indikator-/Titrationsversuche als ausgeführt auszugeben.",
            "wholeUnchangedAcquisitionScope": "Whole unchanged nine-substance Arrhenius P: five acid/four hydroxide names and formulas, solution names, hydrated H3O+/OH-, HCl(g) versus hydrochloric acid, clear limewater and conditional dissociation/solubility. Existing18-card bidirectional recall remains separate.",
            "compilerInputBoundary": "Only existing supported applicabilityOverrides.jurisdiction is used; course/stage/view fields describe placements and do not implement new compiler dimensions.",
            "practicalEvidenceBoundary": "All original actual execution, independent planning, own raw log/digital product/reflection and local safety-release duties remain. Synthetic numbers, author answers and old review metadata are not learner evidence.",
            "officialChoiceBoundary": "Concrete own route supporting already authored targets; no universal state requirement, personal theme selection or new runtime topic selector is claimed."
          },
