            "sourceContextAndLimits": "BB/BE pp34-35 separate common calorimetry/Hess/quantitative energy from LK additions; pp50-51 specify redox donor/acceptor and relevant investigations in both courses. Whole redox-thermometry cases are a related own integrated acquisition. Neither this pairing nor data arithmetic is a complete source thermodynamics/redox/practical pass. The whole canonical thermometric inquiry remains; planning and supplied model measurements are not observed own experimental execution or a school-SOP authorization.",
